      "title": "Recruiter I",
      "description": "Recruiter I - Murfreesboro, Tennessee, Tennessee, United States Visit MTSU Why Choose MTSU Applicant Log In My Profile Kiosk mode Recruiter I 498610 Murfreesboro, Tennessee, Tennessee, United States Admissions and Enrollment Student Affairs and Services Administrative Add to favorites View favorites Job Title Recruiter I Department Undergraduate Recruitment Salary $44,511 - $54,526; commensurate with experience Job Summary/Basic Function Recruit students from high schools and community colleges across the state of Tennessee. Counsel prospective students and their parents, represent students and their parents, represent MTSU at high school recruiting events, and serve as liaison with faculty and staff involved in the admissions process. Extensive travel; occasional evening, weekend and extended work hours required. Activities include cultivate and develop relationships with high school counselors, principals, community college counselors and other persons who influence college enrollment decisions. Required Education Bachelor’s degree required. Required Related Experience Entry level position. No experience required. Required License/Registration/Certification Valid drivers license required. A DMV background check will be conducted prior to the hiring decision. Desirable Related Experience Previous work experience in higher education preferred. Documents Needed to Apply Cover Letter & Resume Required MTSU offers a comprehensive benefits package, including but not limited to the following: Sick Leave Vacation Leave for Administrative/Classified Staff/12-month Faculty 13 paid University holidays Medical, dental, vision, and life insurance Retirement plans Optional 401K and 403B Deferred Compensation Plans Educational benefits for the employee and their spouse and dependents Click here for additional information. MTSU is an equal opportunity employer. All qualified individuals are encouraged to apply. Proof of U.S. citizenship or eligibility for U.