      "description": "Licensed Practical Nurse (LPN) - Murfreesboro, Tennessee, Tennessee, United States Visit MTSU Why Choose MTSU Applicant Log In My Profile Kiosk mode Licensed Practical Nurse (LPN) 498685 Murfreesboro, Tennessee, Tennessee, United States Health Services Classified Add to favorites View favorites Job Title Licensed Practical Nurse (LPN) Department Student Health Services Salary $49,942 - $61,678; commensurate with experience Job Summary/Basic Function • Work with healthcare providers in clinical capacity, rooming patients, performing testing, obtaining and documenting patients’ current symptoms, past medical/ surgical history, current medications, and allergies • Assist university physicians in the evaluation, care and treatment of students' medical complaints following written medical protocol • Collaborate with other departments on campus to aid the students as directed by the healthcare providers • Responsible to the Director of Nursing to carry out duties as assigned Required Education Successful completion of Licensed Practical Nurse program Required Related Experience Two years of LPN experience in a hospital, urgent care, or medical office setting Required License/Registration/Certification Licensed as a License Practical Nurse in Tennessee BLS (Basic Life Support) certification is required prior to the start date or must be obtained within the first month of employment. Desirable Related Experience • Experience in a University Health Setting Documents Needed to Apply Cover Letter & Resume Required MTSU offers a comprehensive benefits package, including but not limited to the following: Sick Leave Vacation Leave for Administrative/Classified Staff/12-month Faculty 13 paid University holidays Medical, dental, vision, and life insurance Retirement plans Optional 401K and 403B Deferred Compensation Plans Educational benefits for the employee and their spouse and dependents Click here for additional information. MTSU is an equal opportunity em